B.fKB=new A.CH("What is NDU Project?","NDU Project is a Project Delivery Operating System (PDOS)\u2014a SaaS platform that integrates AI, analytics, and human decision making to deliver projects from initiation through completion. It replaces disconnected tools with a unified system governing the full project lifecycle.")
